label: Artifacts
description: Artifact rows with public conservation-status context.
catalog: museum_artifact_large
schema: public
table_name: ArtifactsCore
dimensions:
  conservation_status:
    description: 'TEXT. Current conservation status of the artifact. **NULL means no conservation status provided.**. Possible values: Critical, Excellent, Fair, Good, Poor.'
    label: Conservation Status
    ai_context: 'Conservation Status Categories: Values range from ''Excellent'' (recently conserved, no issues), ''Good'' (stable with minor issues), ''Fair'' (stable but with noticeable issues), ''Poor'' (active deterioration), to ''Critical'' (severe deterioration requiring immediate intervention).'
